WEBVTT

00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:31.607
Kwa mfano, katika vyuo bora zaidi,

00:01:31.631 --> 00:01:35.031
idadi wengi wametoka 
familia tajiri sana

00:01:35.055 --> 00:01:39.936
kushinda nusu ya chini ya nchi
ukijumuishwa.

00:01:41.627 --> 00:01:45.647
Shida sio tu 
kushindwa kufikia

00:01:45.671 --> 00:01:48.583
mawazo ya ustahi
tunavyopiga mbiu.

00:01:49.583 --> 00:01:52.458
Wazo lenyewe lina kasoro.

00:01:52.792 --> 00:01:54.426
Ina dosari.

00:01:54.887 --> 00:01:58.958
Ustahi una madhara
kwa manufaa kwa watu wote.

00:01:59.839 --> 00:02:02.344
unaleta kiburi kwa washindi